    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4934f7012131e4ee22bcbff6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "话虽如此，鬼应该也会对我们抱持警戒……\n为了避免被怀疑，我们先乔装打扮，\n再光明正大地登门拜访吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03060d6af372cb48ebb5790a04f3bb0d05d36050745c1213f0dac9cee665eb6c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0119/storytimeline_830119001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
