    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bcbd00aa432a1b377e4ec41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想打倒拥有强大力量的鬼，\n需要先做好周全的准备……！\n首先是好好召开军事会议──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad6dcbbaf5e7dbb1fb9aabeaf7725da071b5642698795682b82e8655eeaaebbf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
