    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98ff0ca9d9342d47553411dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，所谓的山伏就是会去四处寻访\n充满灵气的山脉的人，通常是修验道的行者，\n或是同样正在修行的僧侣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d25d3f423f3c0f14987d743a406bf01b291a0afdbfa7d72ac35abca807c7e279",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0119/storytimeline_830119001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
