      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "他们就类似现代的旅人。\n因为这个时代盛行这种修行方式，\n所以在山里经常能看到他们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd5216e5e1ea80aab0b76627648337c4eb0d37a68418b06b4699c9489201b259",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
